<section class="health-concept" aria-labelledby="health-title" id="health">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 180 180" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative health score, 91 out of 100">
    <circle class="track" cx="90" cy="90" r="72" fill="none" stroke-width="11" />
    <circle
      class="arc"
      cx="90"
      cy="90"
      r="72"
      fill="none"
      stroke-width="11"
      stroke-dasharray="452.4"
      stroke-dashoffset="40.7"
      transform="rotate(-90 90 90)"
    />
    <text x="90" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="number">
      91
    </text>
    <text x="90" y="117" text-anchor="middle" class="caption">
      illustration / 100
    </text>
  </svg>
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Health score · concept preview</span>
    <h2 id="health-title">A useful signal deserves a sound definition.</h2>
    <p>
      A single view of repository health could make changes easier to understand. The scoring
      methodology is still to be defined; this dial is an illustration, not a measurement of your
      repository.
    </p>
    <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'docs/project/roadmap/'}>
      Follow the planned work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
